Subject: [PATCH] Drop stray conflict markers left by 790bb4f9b and the gesture
 tests

The mobile-shell-devel-50 head c99af8f4 has a lone '<<<<<<< HEAD' line in
clutter/clutter/clutter-actor.c (from 790bb4f9b 'clutter: Allow manually
inserting actors into the event emission tree'; no '=======' or '>>>>>>>'
follows), so libmutter-clutter does not compile, and another one in
src/tests/clutter/conform/gesture-relationship.c.
---
 clutter/clutter/clutter-actor.c                  | 1 -
 src/tests/clutter/conform/gesture-relationship.c | 1 -
 2 files changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/clutter/clutter/clutter-actor.c b/clutter/clutter/clutter-actor.c
index 69153a0559..a6daa8405a 100644
--- a/clutter/clutter/clutter-actor.c
+++ b/clutter/clutter/clutter-actor.c
@@ -19108,7 +19108,6 @@ clutter_actor_remove_accessible_state (ClutterActor *actor,
     atk_object_notify_state_change (accessible, state, FALSE);
 }
 
-<<<<<<< HEAD
 void
 clutter_actor_set_cursor_type (ClutterActor      *actor,
                                ClutterCursorType  cursor)
diff --git a/src/tests/clutter/conform/gesture-relationship.c b/src/tests/clutter/conform/gesture-relationship.c
index fc13cae2db..ffce088847 100644
--- a/src/tests/clutter/conform/gesture-relationship.c
+++ b/src/tests/clutter/conform/gesture-relationship.c
@@ -1296,7 +1296,6 @@ gesture_relationship_influencing_event_order (void)
 }
 
 static void
-<<<<<<< HEAD
 gesture_relationship_change (void)
 {
   ClutterActor *stage = clutter_test_get_stage ();
